        "x0": 0.04817656338028169,
        "y0": 0.7839148638468966,
        "x1": 0.22671162005633805,
        "y1": 0.7929064413631425
      },
      "text": "TRYVE. To drive.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1275261971830986,
        "y0": 0.797735162413793,
        "x1": 0.3801624761690141,
        "y1": 0.8160251951803673
      },
      "text": "In chastisynge hath made a rod To tryveawey hire wantonnesse.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2121388169014084,
        "y0": 0.8208883652082759,
        "x1": 0.47812526692957735,
        "y1": 0.8277773596302243
      },
      "text": "Gower, MS. Soc. Antiq. 134, f. 111.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04979594366197183,
        "y0": 0.8330630251724138,
        "x1": 0.3084919436619718,
        "y1": 0.841795677938988
      },
      "text": "TU. To work hard. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0506056338028169,
        "y0": 0.8455149903986207,
        "x1": 0.4789357667605634,
        "y1": 0.8679035053855951
      },
      "text": "TUARN. The place in an iron furnace which receives the metal. StaJ''.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.051415323943661974,
        "y0": 0.8730284696703449,
        "x1": 0.18096250771830982,
        "y1": 0.8821348999282342
      },
      "text": "TUAY. Two.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13076495774647884,
        "y0": 0.8851262146551725,
        "x1": 0.3878407677746477,
        "y1": 0.8927395592716956
      },
      "text": "From arnemorwe to the midday.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13157464788732393,
        "y0": 0.8967306233944827,
        "x1": 0.42103887323943656,
        "y1": 0.9047059281664888
      },
      "text": "He hadde strengthe of knightes tuay.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2716510422535211,
        "y0": 0.9103138236082758,
        "x1": 0.48014625352112666,
        "y1": 0.9172018195225042
      },
      "text": "Arthour and Merlin, p. 178.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.053844394366197174,
        "y0": 0.9225481868427586,
        "x1": 0.4817729210140843,
        "y1": 0.943670536847482
      },
      "text": "TUB. (1) Tale of a tub, a stupid nonsensical story.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49755459154929577,
        "y0": 0.07699204446482762,
        "x1": 0.8084756056338027,
        "y1": 0.08634498205178226
      },
      "text": "The top of a malt-kiln. Essex.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4967449014084507,
        "y0": 0.0904494648993105,
        "x1": 0.7105014792112674,
        "y1": 0.09997360274143756
      },
      "text": "The gurnet. Cornw.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4967449014084507,
        "y0": 0.10335132824000005,
        "x1": 0.9238499731830981,
        "y1": 0.15088172441713069
      },
      "text": "One mode of curing the lues venerea was by the tub, the patient sweating for a considerable time in a heated tub. This mode is often alluded to by early writers.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49472067605633796,
        "y0": 0.15483187684275865,
        "x1": 0.8295291686760565,
        "y1": 0.16498242293377127
      },
      "text": "TUBBAN. A clod of earth. Cornw.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4943158309859154,
        "y0": 0.16798014068965528,
        "x1": 0.768807266253521,
        "y1": 0.1784212990208871
      },
      "text": "TUBBER. A cooper. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4939109859154929,
        "y0": 0.18159353201517248,
        "x1": 0.7829687468169012,
        "y1": 0.19174407810618513
      },
      "text": "TUBBLE. A mattock. Devon.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4939109859154929,
        "y0": 0.1957710144289656,
        "x1": 0.9226386767323945,
        "y1": 0.23120318749482377
      },
      "text": "TUB-IRON. An iron placed in front of a smith's fire-place, having a hole through which the spout of the bellows is put.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.23596771927448285,
        "x1": 0.7805372473239436,
        "y1": 0.24505500740876487
      },
      "text": "TUBLE. Earthenware. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.24801731310344838,
        "x1": 0.7740572971267609,
        "y1": 0.25849179792099775
      },
      "text": "TU-BRUGGE. A drawbridge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.2625581741917242,
        "x1": 0.8416623754366196,
        "y1": 0.27154975170796997
      },
      "text": "TUCK. (1) To eat. Also, an appetite.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.2752427031572414,
        "x1": 0.7400608371830985,
        "y1": 0.2860856887966669
      },
      "text": "(2) A short pinafore. East.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.2900161279848277,
        "x1": 0.9218362738028163,
        "y1": 0.3108938495940421
      },
      "text": "To smart with pain. Wilts. In Devonshire, to pinch severely.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.3149062216703449,
        "x1": 0.6631313672112676,
        "y1": 0.3259417953165047
      },
      "text": "(4) A slap. Devon.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.3282870492565517,
        "x1": 0.922235451042253,
        "y1": 0.36421490188703265
      },
      "text": "A horizontal fold made in a garment to accommodate it to the height of a growing person.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49229160563380275,
        "y0": 0.3700533003986208,
        "x1": 0.7185927127887325,
        "y1": 0.3797514819001151
      },
      "text": "(6) To touch. Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.3818103596013793,
        "x1": 0.7327728162253521,
        "y1": 0.3921991855734379
      },
      "text": "(7) A rapier. Still in use.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.3965671624675863,
        "x1": 0.6922899285633801,
        "y1": 0.40575029239660987
      },
      "text": "(8) To chuck. Cornw.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.4080764285668966,
        "x1": 0.7659668732394366,
        "y1": 0.4188833268793685
      },
      "text": "TUCKER. (1) A fuller. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.4234068030855172,
        "x1": 0.7526086052957746,
        "y1": 0.4320163613621272
      },
      "text": "(2) The same as Pinner, q. v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.4350858768427587,
        "x1": 0.8546319921126763,
        "y1": 0.4452364229337713
      },
      "text": "TUCKER-IN. A chambermaid. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.4482189113255172,
        "x1": 0.8817622796619721,
        "y1": 0.45836945741652985
      },
      "text": "TUCKET. A slight flourish on a trumpet.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.4618475320151724,
        "x1": 0.9218322253521126,
        "y1": 0.48478351677511766
      },
      "text": "TUCKING. A bag used for carrying beans in when setting them. Glouc.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.4890730112744828,
        "x1": 0.9214273802816905,
        "y1": 0.511416518784606
      },
      "text": "TUCKING-GIRDLE. \" Tuckyng kyrdell, samcture decourser,\" Palsgrave.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.5162217192744829,
        "x1": 0.9218354641126755,
        "y1": 0.5382650729104764
      },
      "text": "TUCKS. Iron pins in the frame of a timbertug to prevent the timber slipping off.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49188676056338027,
        "y0": 0.5425962324137931,
        "x1": 0.8044328227605632,
        "y1": 0.5521672942174224
      },
      "text": "TUCKSHELLS. Tusks. Sussex.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4926964507042253,
        "y0": 0.5567318477048276,
        "x1": 0.7679894792112674,
        "y1": 0.566339688796667
      },
      "text": "TUE. (1) To rumple. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49310129577464784,
        "y0": 0.5705959065337932,
        "x1": 0.7303388876619717,
        "y1": 0.5797205163828738
      },
      "text": "(2) The same as I'ew, q. v.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49229160563380275,
        "y0": 0.5822749802910345,
        "x1": 0.7408624304225353,
        "y1": 0.5930818786035065
      },
      "text": "TUEL. (1) A towel. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935061408450704,
        "y0": 0.5973575617062069,
        "x1": 0.7886381971830985,
        "y1": 0.6069582923966099
      },
      "text": "(2) The fundament. See Tewel.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935061408450704,
        "y0": 0.6092844285668966,
        "x1": 0.8060497739718306,
        "y1": 0.620586913086265
      },
      "text": "(3) A vexatious meddling. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49229160563380275,
        "y0": 0.6234075104827586,
        "x1": 0.6364132119436618,
        "y1": 0.6326305336753468
      },
      "text": "TUEN. To go.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5712363943661971,
        "y0": 0.6366163696551724,
        "x1": 0.843296330140845,
        "y1": 0.6435771418759937
      },
      "text": "Ant alle the other that mine buen,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5720460845070422,
        "y0": 0.647218197586207,
        "x1": 0.7979496338028167,
        "y1": 0.6554841145984321
      },
      "text": "Shule to blisse with me tuen.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7291259718309859,
        "y0": 0.660389278222069,
        "x1": 0.9230443314929577,
        "y1": 0.6670594382026709
      },
      "text": "Harrowing of Hell, p. 29.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4935061408450704,
        "y0": 0.6712479337931034,
        "x1": 0.7570586623098595,
        "y1": 0.6823068612104599
      },
      "text": "TUFF. (1) A Turkish turban.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49472067605633796,
        "y0": 0.6898448062068966,
        "x1": 0.5202259154929577,
        "y1": 0.6959354819001151
      },
      "text": "(2)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5291325070422535,
        "y0": 0.6848765544827586,
        "x1": 0.9230499993239443,
        "y1": 0.6953177128139905
      },
      "text": "A tassel. Also, to ornament with tassels.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49472067605633796,
        "y0": 0.6982421527048277,
        "x1": 0.6667838794366197,
        "y1": 0.7098118956932187
      },
      "text": "(3) A lock of wool.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4951255211267605,
        "y0": 0.7131311631034484,
        "x1": 0.7424858591549295,
        "y1": 0.7222787171363018
      },
      "text": "(4) To spit or hiss, as a cat.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49472067605633796,
        "y0": 0.7250190372413793,
        "x1": 0.8740605070422535,
        "y1": 0.7354601955726111
      },
      "text": "TUFFOLD. A small outhouse. YorJcsh.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4951255211267605,
        "y0": 0.738152071724138,
        "x1": 0.7841913789295769,
        "y1": 0.7485932300553698
      },
      "text": "TUFT; A grove, or plantation.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4951255211267605,
        "y0": 0.7510525424675862,
        "x1": 0.9254790697464795,
        "y1": 0.7748140261414703
      },
      "text": "TUFT-HUNTER. A hanger-on to noblemen and persons of quality.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.49553036619718305,
        "y0": 0.7786177262482759,
        "x1": 0.9258774372957747,
        "y1": 0.8009709073096366
      },
      "text": "TUFT-MOCKADO. A mixed stuff-made to imitate tufted taffeta, or velvet.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4967449014084507,
        "y0": 0.8045453940841379,
        "x1": 0.9262822823661971,
        "y1": 0.8278771623406019
      },
      "text": "TUFT-TAFFATY. A taffaty tufted, or left with a nap on it, like velvet.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.517392,
        "y0": 0.8343819039655173,
        "x1": 0.8392438309859155,
        "y1": 0.8410032021952745
      },
      "text": "Sleeveless his jerkin was, and it had been",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5177968450704225,
        "y0": 0.845290014084138,
        "x1": 0.904023090704225,
        "y1": 0.852928554784036
      },
      "text": "Velvet, but 'twas now (so much ground was seen)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5177968450704225,
        "y0": 0.8577410327406897,
        "x1": 0.8497738512676056,
        "y1": 0.8648949663906386
      },
      "text": "Become tufftaffaty ; and our children shall",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5186065352112675,
        "y0": 0.8708117571696552,
        "x1": 0.7145450717746478,
        "y1": 0.8768049820517824
      },
      "text": "See it plain rash a while, then nought at all.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7574651267605632,
        "y0": 0.8824789219903448,
        "x1": 0.9279016626478873,
        "y1": 0.8884866699750519
      },
      "text": "Donne's Poems, p. 129.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4987691267605633,
        "y0": 0.8942617268965517,
        "x1": 0.7849945915492955,
        "y1": 0.9053401196794825
      },
      "text": "TUG. (1) A contest. Var. dial.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4999836619718309,
        "y0": 0.9081229113255173,
        "x1": 0.7849929721690143,
        "y1": 0.9197121196794824
      },
      "text": "(2) A timber-carriage. Sussex.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5007933521126761,
        "y0": 0.9228797141917241,
        "x1": 0.7615168162253518,
        "y1": 0.9328256887966668
      },
      "text": "(3) To rob ; to spoil. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5007933521126761,
        "y0": 0.9346520027586207,
        "x1": 0.8076659154929576,
        "y1": 0.946225981748448
      },
      "text": "(4) A difficult undertaking. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
